    "background_story": "Belen had always been fascinated by the stars and the mysteries of space. Growing up, she spent countless nights gazing up at the night sky, dreaming of the day she could explore the cosmos. After years of hard work and dedication, Belen finally landed a job at a prestigious space agency. She quickly rose through the ranks, becoming a leading expert in rocket propulsion. When the agency announced plans to launch a new Mars expedition, Belen was chosen to lead the mission. As the launch date approached, she worked tirelessly to ensure everything was perfect. Finally, the day arrived, and Belen watched anxiously as the rocket soared into the sky, carrying the hopes and dreams of humanity to the red planet. With the successful launch, Belen's career reached new heights, and she became a trailblazer for women in space exploration.",
